---
/** Four illustrative app screens beside the home screen in the hero. */
---

<section
  id="screens"
  class="section section-alt"
  aria-labelledby="screens-title"
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Inside the app</p>
      <h2 id="screens-title">Seven screens instead of a 17-tab spreadsheet</h2>
      <p>
        Each tab answers one question. Every number taps through to the
        transactions behind it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="gallery" role="list">
      <li>
        <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="scr">
            <p class="scr-title">Activity</p>
            <p class="search">Search payees, amounts, tags</p>
            <p class="group">Today</p>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="ico ico-food">J</span>
              <span class="who">
                Java House<small>Eating out</small>
              </span>
              <span class="amt">−450</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="ico ico-shop">N</span>
              <span class="who">
                Naivas<small>Groceries</small>
              </span>
              <span class="amt">−2,340</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="ico ico-own">K</span>
              <span class="who">
                To my KCB<small>Not spending</small>
              </span>
              <span class="amt muted">5,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="group">Yesterday</p>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="ico ico-in">S</span>
              <span class="who">
                Salary<small>Income</small>
              </span>
              <span class="amt in">+85,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="prompt">
              <b>0700 000 000</b> sent you 1,500. Who is this?
              <span class="chip">Name payee</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Activity</h3>
        <p>
          Where did my money go? Moves between your own accounts never count as
          spending.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="scr">
            <p class="scr-title">Plan · November</p>
            <div class="split">
              <p>
                Expected income <b>120,000</b>
              </p>
              <div class="stack">
                <span style="--w: 30%; --c: var(--color-brand)"></span>
                <span style="--w: 38%; --c: #c98a5a"></span>
                <span style="--w: 12%; --c: #7a8fb8"></span>
                <span style="--w: 20%; --c: var(--color-success)"></span>
              </div>
              <p class="legend">Debt · Living · School · Savings</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>Rent</span>
              <span class="st st-done">Done</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>Groceries</span>
              <span class="st st-prog">62%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>Transport</span>
              <span class="st st-prog">48%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>Eating out</span>
              <span class="st st-over">Over</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>School fees</span>
              <span class="st">Due 5th</span>
            </div>
            <div class="surplus">Surplus 8,200 → debt 5,000, savings 3,200</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Plan</h3>
        <p>
          What is coming, and is it covered? Bills, set-asides and where any
          surplus goes.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="scr">
            <p class="scr-title">Debts</p>
            <div class="hero-num">
              <small>Debt-free by</small>
              <b>Aug 2028</b>
              <div class="bar">
                <span style="--w: 38%"></span>
              </div>
              <small>38% paid · avalanche</small>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>
                KCB loan<small>13% a year</small>
              </span>
              <b>180,000</b>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>
                Fuliza<small>9 draws this month</small>
              </span>
              <b>3,200</b>
            </div>
            <div class="cat">
              <span>
                Mum<small>Family · no interest</small>
              </span>
              <b>20,000</b>
            </div>
            <div class="whatif">
              <small>What if I add 5,000 a month?</small>
              <div class="slider">
                <span></span>
              </div>
              <b>Debt-free Feb 2028 · saves 14,600</b>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Debts</h3>
        <p>
          Bank, Fuliza and family loans in one plan, with a payday split and
          what-ifs.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="scr">
            <p class="scr-title">Insights</p>
            <div class="score">
              <div class="ring" style="--p: 64">
                <b>64</b>
              </div>
              <div>
                <b>Coping</b>
                <small>Up 6 from October</small>
                <small class="tip">Biggest lift: fewer Fuliza draws</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="group">Leaks this month · 6,400 (9%)</p>
            <div class="hbar">
              <span style="--w: 90%">Friends and family</span>
              <b>2,900</b>
            </div>
            <div class="hbar">
              <span style="--w: 62%">Lifestyle</span>
              <b>2,000</b>
            </div>
            <div class="hbar">
              <span style="--w: 34%">Fees</span>
              <b>1,100</b>
            </div>
            <div class="hbar">
              <span style="--w: 14%">Fuliza</span>
              <b>400</b>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Insights</h3>
        <p>
          What should I change? A health score, your leaks, and the one action
          that helps most.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gallery {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15.5rem), 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gallery > li {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .gallery {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-4);
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      margin-inline: calc(var(--gutter) * -1);
      padding: 0 var(--gutter) var(--space-3);
      scroll-padding-inline: var(--gutter);
    }

    .gallery > li {
      flex: 0 0 80%;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
  }

  .gallery h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-1);
  }

  .gallery > li > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .device {
    max-width: 17.5rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 2.4rem;
    background: var(--color-device);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgb(58 47 51 / 0.4);
  }

  .scr {
    min-height: 29rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-4);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .scr p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .scr small {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .scr-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3) !important;
  }

  .search {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .group {
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ico {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 9px;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .ico-food {
    background: #c98a5a;
  }

  .ico-shop {
    background: #7a8fb8;
  }

  .ico-own {
    background: #9a8c90;
  }

  .ico-in {
    background: var(--color-success);
  }

  .who {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .who small {
    font-weight: 400;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .amt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .amt.muted {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .amt.in {
    color: var(--color-success-text);
  }

  .prompt {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
  }

  .chip {
    display: table;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    padding: 0.15rem var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-on-brand);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .split {
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .split b {
    float: right;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .stack {
    display: flex;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0;
  }

  .stack span {
    width: var(--w);
    background: var(--c);
  }

  .legend {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .cat {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cat > b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .st {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.1rem var(--space-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .st-done {
    color: var(--color-success-text);
  }

  .st-prog {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .st-over {
    color: var(--color-brand-link);
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .surplus {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--color-success) 12%,
      var(--color-surface)
    );
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-num {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero-num b {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-brand-link);
  }

  .bar,
  .slider {
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
    margin: var(--space-2) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bar span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: var(--w);
    background: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .whatif {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
  }

  .slider {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .slider span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 55%;
    top: -4px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .score {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ring {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 4rem;
    height: 4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-surface) 58%, transparent 60%),
      conic-gradient(
        var(--color-brand) calc(var(--p) * 1%),
        var(--color-brand-soft) 0
      );
  }

  .ring b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .tip {
    color: var(--color-brand-link) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hbar span {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.25rem var(--space-2);
    z-index: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hbar span::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: var(--w);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .trend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    height: 3.5rem;
  }

  .trend span {
    flex: 1;
    height: var(--h);
    border-radius: 6px 6px 2px 2px;
    background: var(--color-brand-soft);
  }

  .trend span:last-child {
    background: var(--color-brand);
  }

  .hbar b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }
</style>
